## 10. Full-text search (FTS): BM25 over node table string properties

Kùzu’s FTS extension:

* Builds an index over one or more **STRING properties** (node tables only, as documented). ([Kuzu][10])
* `QUERY_FTS_INDEX` uses **Okapi BM25** scoring internally. ([Kuzu][10])
* `CREATE_FTS_INDEX` supports:

  * `stemmer` selection (many languages + `none`)
  * custom `stopwords` sources (table or file, including remote with httpfs) ([Kuzu][10])

This gives you “lexical retrieval” alongside vector retrieval, both integrated into Cypher workflows. ([Kuzu][10])

